John Burnet. Second edition, A. and C. Black, 1908.

[Retained EPUB](../books/burnet-early-greek-philosophy.epub) · [Original book and publication notices](https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/67097). English. Project Gutenberg identifies this edition as public domain in the USA; its notices and production credits remain in the retained file.

Used passages: Chapter I, The Milesian School; Chapter III, Herakleitos of Ephesos; Chapter IV, Parmenides of Elea; Chapter IX, Leukippos of Miletos. Its translated fragments and ancient reports are distinct from Burnet's reconstruction and the historical assumptions of his period. [Reading path](../presocratics/Nature-and-being.lingua#r_61M87EN28QQ9AHXT80SPCB0CVH).

